# LIFELINE AI service configuration
#
# Base URL of the remote Gemma inference API. LIFELINE will POST to
# `${VITE_GEMMA_API_URL}/generate` with { prompt, system_prompt,
# temperature, max_new_tokens } and expect { "response": "..." }.
#
# The API must hold any private credentials itself — the browser never
# sees an API key. Leave blank to run entirely on the offline provider.
VITE_GEMMA_API_URL=